id: switch
name: Switch (on/off setting)
category: inputs
summary: A native checkbox styled as an MD3 switch with an icon in the selected thumb. Takes effect immediately.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Track 52x32dp, shape full. Thumb 16dp off (outline), 24dp on (on-primary), 28dp pressed. Selected track is primary.
- Selected thumb shows a check icon, so state is not carried by color alone.
- Label in Body Large to the side. The whole row is the 48dp touch target.
- Use for settings that apply immediately. For a choice that needs a Save button, use a checkbox.
@@a11y
- <input type="checkbox" role="switch"> inside a <label>, so the label text is the name and the native toggle behavior stays.
- Do not change the label when the state changes ("Dark mode", not "Dark mode on").
- Disabled uses the disabled attribute.
@@html
<label class="md-switch">
  <input class="md-switch__input" type="checkbox" role="switch" checked>
  <span class="md-switch__track" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="md-switch__thumb"><span class="md-icon md-switch__check" aria-hidden="true">check</span></span>
  </span>
  <span class="md-switch__label">Price alerts</span>
</label>
@@css
.md-switch {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sp-lg);
  min-height: 3rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.md-switch__input {
  position: absolute;
  width: 0.0625rem;
  height: 0.0625rem;
  opacity: 0;
}

.md-switch__track {
  position: relative;
  flex: none;
  width: 3.25rem;
  height: 2rem;
  border: 0.125rem solid var(--md-outline);
  border-radius: var(--shape-full);
  background: var(--md-surface-4);
  transition:
    background-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects),
    border-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects);
}

.md-switch__thumb {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 0.375rem;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 1rem;
  height: 1rem;
  border-radius: var(--shape-full);
  background: var(--md-outline);
  color: var(--md-primary);
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  transition:
    left var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial),
    width var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial),
    height var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial),
    background-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects);
}

.md-switch__check { font-size: 1rem; opacity: 0; }

.md-switch:hover .md-switch__thumb { background: var(--md-on-surface-variant); }
.md-switch__input:active ~ .md-switch__track .md-switch__thumb { width: 1.75rem; height: 1.75rem; }

.md-switch__input:checked ~ .md-switch__track {
  border-color: var(--md-primary);
  background: var(--md-primary);
}
.md-switch__input:checked ~ .md-switch__track .md-switch__thumb {
  left: 1.5rem;
  width: 1.5rem;
  height: 1.5rem;
  background: var(--md-on-primary);
}
.md-switch__input:checked ~ .md-switch__track .md-switch__check { opacity: 1; }

.md-switch__input:focus-visible ~ .md-switch__track {
  outline: 0.1875rem solid var(--md-secondary);
  outline-offset: 0.125rem;
}

.md-switch__label {
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-large-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-large-tracking);
}

.md-switch__input:disabled ~ .md-switch__track { opacity: var(--md-opacity-disabled-content); }
.md-switch__input:disabled ~ .md-switch__label { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--md-on-surface) 38%, transparent); }
@@notes
The thumb sits inside an aria-hidden track on purpose: the native input already exposes role, name and state.
